              "content": "Returns the status of the report view.\nThe report view has following lifecycle:\n  - PENDING - creation of report view is scheduled\n  - RUNNING - report view is being created\n  - SUCCESS - report view has been successfully created\n  - FAILED - report view could not have been created\n  - DELETED - report view older then 24h have been deleted",
